WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Close the lab, then open Sync in Analytical Adventure.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
On your first device, turn on sync and copy your private AA code.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
On the other device, open Sync and link it using that AA code.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Wait for Synced across devices before switching. Keep your code private.
